          "jcr:created": "Thu Apr 21 2022 18:24:21 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h1><span class=\"futura-bold\">Complex surgical access and decompression</span></h1>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Exposing the spine as efficiently as possible is a critical part of spine surgery. OR staff must be knowledgeable about these delicate surgical techniques and the best practices for successful outcomes. This section will provide educational content to review the latest evidence-based approach to these procedures.</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri May 13 2022 17:56:59 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
