          "jcr:created": "Thu Mar 17 2022 18:41:35 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h2>Cranial Anatomy &amp; Procedural Overview<br>\n</h2>\n<h3>Learning objectives<br>\n</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>List and describe the location of the bones in the skull<br>\n</li>\n<li>List the lobes of the brain<br>\n</li>\n<li>Describe the meninges with name and location<br>\n</li>\n<li>Describe the general steps of a craniotomy<br>\n</li>\n<li>List the types of craniotomies and rationale for approach<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
